---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="NO BALL GAMES Collections | Physical Art, Clothing & Digital Collectibles"
  description="NO BALL GAMES collections page for future drops, physical art, hand-painted clothing, prints, digital collectibles and collector-focused releases."
  current="collections"
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <span class="eyebrow">Collections</span>
    <h1>Collect the culture before it gets cleaned up.</h1>
    <p>
      This is the section for physical pieces, digital releases, limited clothing, prints, collectibles, character drops and future archive work.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="section card-grid">
    <article class="feature-card">
      <span class="kicker">Physical</span>
      <h3>Original art</h3>
      <p>One-of-one canvases, hand-finished works, sign-inspired pieces, character artwork and raw studio output.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="feature-card">
      <span class="kicker">Wearable</span>
      <h3>Painted clothing</h3>
      <p>Military jackets, denim, stencil garments and streetwear pieces that carry the NO BALL GAMES attitude into the real world.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="feature-card">
      <span class="kicker">Digital</span>
      <h3>Digital collectibles</h3>
      <p>Future-ready structure for NFTs, collector passes, character cards, rarity tiers and community rewards.</p>
    </article>
  </section>

  <section class="section split-grid">
    <article class="panel-card">
      <span class="kicker">Drop structure</span>
      <h2>Make every release feel limited.</h2>
      <p>
        The strongest version of this brand does not dump random products. It releases controlled drops with story, scarcity, proof, archive value and a clear reason to collect.
      </p>
    </article>
    <article class="panel-card">
      <span class="kicker">Suggested categories</span>
      <ul class="list-clean">
        <li>Original one-of-one artworks.</li>
        <li>Limited prints and signed editions.</li>
        <li>Hand-painted jackets and custom garments.</li>
        <li>Character collectible drops.</li>
        <li>Community reward items and access passes.</li>
      </ul>
    </article>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
